{
  "name": "Customer Support Ticket Automation",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🎫 Customer Support Ticket Automation\n\nYe workflow customer ki support email ko apne aap sambhalta hai. Maine ise aise banaya:\n\n1. **Ticket aata hai** (Webhook) — customer ka naam, email, subject aur message.\n2. **Ticket ID banta hai** (Code) — har ticket ko ek unique number aur time milta hai.\n3. **Purana ticket check** — dekhta hai ke yehi customer yehi masla pehle to nahi bhej chuka (duplicate).\n4. **AI sochta hai** (Google Gemini) — batata hai: asli / spam / unclear, kis baare mein hai (intent), mood (sentiment), kitna zaroori (urgency), chhota summary, aur ek tayyar jawab.\n5. **Sahi rah chunta hai** (Switch):\n   • Asli customer → agar bohat zaroori ya ghussay mein hai to **manager ko alert** jata hai + customer ko jawab.\n   • Warna seedha customer ko jawab.\n   • Spam / Unclear → apna apna jawab.\n6. **Jawab email** (Gmail) — customer ko personalized reply chala jata hai.\n7. **Record rakhta hai** (Google Sheet) — har ticket ki poori detail + status (New / In Progress / Replied / Escalated / Spam) save ho jati hai.\n\nAage chal kar WhatsApp ya Slack bhi asaani se add ho sakta hai.",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "0ba0a365-85fd-4135-a4d6-ea43d4df394d",
      "name": "How this workflow works",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        -288
      ]
    },
